abstract: >-
  One thousand graded football predictions written before kickoff and scored
  exactly once afterwards, with market-implied probabilities as a baseline.
  Rows are append-only; failures are retained.
keywords:
  - football
  - forecasting
  - calibration
  - brier score
  - evaluation
